    "The capture lists course options only for Humanities and Fine Arts (Group A and Group B); approved courses for Social and Behavioral Sciences, Natural Sciences, Mathematics, History, and English Composition are not in the capture.",
    "The Data Analytics Concentration (DAT 3301, DAT 3311, DAT 4302, DAT 4301; 12 credits) is listed as available, but the capture does not state for this degree whether it is optional or required, or whether it reduces the 42 open elective credits. It is left out of the ledger because 30 + 48 + 42 already equals 120.",
    "The open electives text refers to 'degree program upper-level requirements', but the capture does not state the number of upper-level credits required.",
    "No residency or institutional-credit requirement for this program is stated in the capture.",
    "The course code 'ITC 4708' is recorded as printed. It may be a misprint of ITC 4308, which would match the numbering of the other ITC courses; this should be verified against the course listing.",
    "The capture also contains partial text for other programs (B.S. Information Systems and Cyber Security, B.S. Organizational Leadership). Those programs are not complete in the capture and were not used for this ledger."
